OL,3,AFlu vaccine rollout begins as NHS
OL,4,Aregroups from 'busiest summer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis winter's flu vaccine has been
OL,7,Fupdated to protect against last year's
OL,8,FSuper-K strain, with the first doses
OL,9,Fbeing given to schoolchildren and
OL,10,Fpregnant women.
OL,12,FFlu hit early last winter, with a new
OL,13,Fmutated version of the virus
OL,14,Fcirculating - a seasonal influenza
OL,15,Fcalled subclade K or Super-K.
OL,17,FSchool children are being prioritised -
OL,18,Fand like pregnant women can get the jab
OL,19,Ffrom Tuesday - because they can catch
OL,20,Fand spread flu easily. Protecting them
OL,21,Falso helps others, including baby
OL,22,Fbrothers or sisters and grandparents.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
