OL,3,AFlu vaccine rollout begins as NHS
OL,4,Aregroups from 'busiest summer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOther eligible groups, including people
OL,7,Faged 65 and over, can get a free NHS
OL,8,Fflu shot from October and should
OL,9,Freceive an invite by phone or post.
